ularity but there  are no areas grossly suspicious for invasive carcinoma  The specimen is  entirely submitted   MICRO  1 7  Central area of specimen  where two localizing wires were located    mult frags  ESS   MICRO  8 10  Portion of specimen lateral to central region of breast  mult  frags  ESS   MICRO  11 13  Portion of specimen medial to central region of breast  mult  frags  ESS   Reports to  CHRISTIAN  ROGER  L  M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST   EXCISIONAL TISSUE W MARGINS   report_end  , no_Medullary.
