ith a central REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm hemorrhagic focus  which comes to 0 4cm of the anterior  0 8cm of the superior  1 3cm of the inferior  1 1cm of the posterior  1 1cm of the inferior  and 1 3cm of the superior margins  The specimen is entirely submitted from superior to inferior as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the superior margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the interior margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the hemorrhagic focus as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION  report_end  , no_Medullary.
